    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d892">

                <pb facs="1183" n="1173" sameAs="frus:frus1945v07/pg1173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">102.1/10–1645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Robertson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-11-01T13:00:00-05:00">November 1, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1774. For Adler from the Secretary of the Treasury.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>ANLC representative John K. Howard<anchor n="66" xml:id="d892-f1"/>
                        leaving Washington immediately for Chungking to negotiate disposal of
                        surplus property in China. He has been informed that Adler will be available
                        in Chungking for discussions with him. (Re our 1680, October 16.)</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>If Adler is not in Chungking now, please inform him to return to Chungking
                        by November 1.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>What is the status of the proposal regarding yuan advances and surplus
                        property outlined in our cable of October 16. This is a matter of top
                        priority. [Morgenthau.]</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d892-f1" n="66" xml:id="d892-f1-content">
                <p>Special Representative of the Foreign Liquidation Commissioner for the China
                    Theater.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
